WEBVTT

01:00.390 --> 01:07.230
It is said that 70% of the
human brain's capacity is unused.

01:09.240 --> 01:11.300
It's also thought that...

01:11.870 --> 01:15.070
...the mysterious powers that humans
have are hidden in this part of the brain.

01:17.010 --> 01:21.570
The 70% of the brain that is not used...

01:22.350 --> 01:24.080
...is often called this...

01:24.150 --> 01:29.890
<i>Night Head Genesis</i>

01:38.470 --> 01:41.530
Tonight, two brothers will escape.

01:51.780 --> 01:53.270
Two brothers...

02:00.860 --> 02:02.190
<i>Impatience</i>

02:02.190 --> 02:05.920
<i>Impatience
Episode 3</i>

02:07.500 --> 02:09.860
Why didn't you tell us right away?

02:10.100 --> 02:10.890
What?

02:11.300 --> 02:14.930
You noticed that Shouko-san
disappeared yesterday, but...

02:15.040 --> 02:17.900
...you didn't say anything
till early evening, right?

02:18.210 --> 02:19.040
Yes...

02:19.110 --> 02:22.740
She disappeared but left
her bag and cell phone there...

02:23.040 --> 02:25.980
Didn't you think something happened?

02:26.950 --> 02:28.350
Well...

02:31.150 --> 02:32.080
Excuse me.

02:33.220 --> 02:36.280
As we thought, there is no evidence
of her running away from home.

02:36.590 --> 02:38.490
Shouko running away from home...

02:39.160 --> 02:41.390
There is no way that would happen!

02:41.460 --> 02:42.120
Yumiko...

02:43.600 --> 02:44.560
Well...

02:45.470 --> 02:47.490
I thought she would come back.

02:47.970 --> 02:52.910
There have been times before
where she disappeared.

02:53.140 --> 02:55.700
Shouko disappeared once in a while.

02:56.280 --> 02:58.070
But she always came back right away.

02:58.280 --> 03:01.110
So that's why I thought
I shouldn't cause havoc again.

03:01.620 --> 03:03.380
Disappears and comes back?

03:04.750 --> 03:05.950
What do you mean?

03:06.220 --> 03:10.160
Yesterday there was an accident
on the Toumei Highway.

03:10.490 --> 03:14.890
<i>Toumei Disastrous Accident, 7 Deaths</i>

03:10.790 --> 03:12.960
Oh, the serious collision accident...

03:12.990 --> 03:14.890
...I think 7 people died.

03:15.500 --> 03:19.230
The truth is my family
was planning to take a trip to Izu.

03:19.470 --> 03:23.200
But Shouko told me strongly
not to go by car.

03:23.970 --> 03:26.840
So I convinced my father.

03:27.610 --> 03:29.410
Then the accident happened.

03:30.280 --> 03:31.040
No way...

03:35.980 --> 03:40.390
Shouko saved us.

04:03.180 --> 04:04.370
Mikuriya-sensei...

04:06.580 --> 04:08.610
Nishikido-san was
saying to contact him.

04:15.690 --> 04:16.880
This is Mikuriya.

04:17.760 --> 04:19.390
Are you done with the funeral?

04:20.160 --> 04:21.030
Yeah.

04:21.100 --> 04:23.620
Having a burial without
having them cremated...

04:23.760 --> 04:26.060
Strictly speaking that's illegal.

04:26.230 --> 04:27.860
Don't say such an uptight thing.

04:28.140 --> 04:30.330
Let's keep it at tacit permission.

04:31.370 --> 04:33.500
So let's hear the reason you called.

04:34.280 --> 04:37.270
Last night at a drive-in
a little way away from there...

04:37.780 --> 04:40.110
...there was a small incident.

04:40.210 --> 04:41.180
An incident?

04:42.080 --> 04:45.480
A pretty well built strong-looking guy
was brought to the hospital...

04:45.550 --> 04:48.350
...for a fractured bone
and a cerebral concussion.

04:48.920 --> 04:52.220
Also four men and women complained
about abnormalities in their bodies...

04:52.290 --> 04:53.920
...and had detailed examinations done.

04:55.330 --> 04:58.730
The victims are saying that a person
with supernatural powers did it.

04:59.400 --> 05:01.330
A person with supernatural powers...

05:02.300 --> 05:04.100
They are saying it was two people.

05:04.340 --> 05:07.000
I attached the pictures of the
scene of the crime to the email.

05:17.450 --> 05:19.610
Energy left behind, huh?

05:27.630 --> 05:31.590
But this is the first time a photograph
has come out this clearly.

05:32.000 --> 05:35.990
A 3rd rate magazine reporter
came to the scene of the incident.

05:36.600 --> 05:40.230
They submitted what they took
at the scene to the police.

05:40.910 --> 05:44.140
Of course I took care of it
so it won't become public.

05:44.680 --> 05:48.140
Why did a magazine reporter
go to a place like that?

05:48.920 --> 05:52.280
The truth is there was a body of
a murdered woman found at...

05:52.690 --> 05:55.050
...a love hotel about 50 km
away from that restaurant, so...

05:55.120 --> 05:57.750
...they stopped by on the way
back from there apparently.

05:58.030 --> 05:59.250
A murdered woman's body?

05:59.360 --> 06:01.330
The criminal hasn't been found yet.

06:01.760 --> 06:05.490
Recently three murders of
young women have occurred...

06:06.400 --> 06:09.490
...and all the victims were
wearing purple clothing.

06:10.640 --> 06:12.900
Purple clothing, huh?

06:13.670 --> 06:15.940
I will give you a call
if anything else happens.

06:22.280 --> 06:24.270
There are some things
I want you to gather.

06:25.090 --> 06:29.580
The data on the murders of
young women that've been happening...

06:30.060 --> 06:31.180
Understood.

07:57.110 --> 07:58.140
Brother...

07:58.480 --> 08:00.140
Yeah, I'm here.

08:01.820 --> 08:04.580
Brother, I'm scared.

08:04.950 --> 08:07.610
Naoya, it's okay. I'm with you.

08:11.530 --> 08:12.180
What's wrong?

08:12.630 --> 08:13.850
I can see it...

08:15.560 --> 08:16.550
Those two...

08:18.200 --> 08:21.220
Before they came to that restaurant,
with a young woman...

08:21.940 --> 08:22.600
Naoya!

08:22.600 --> 08:23.570
Naoya!
I can see it...

08:23.770 --> 08:25.170
I cant see it clearly!

08:35.780 --> 08:37.050
Thank you!

08:37.680 --> 08:38.740
Lucky!

08:39.120 --> 08:41.520
Isn't it kind of dangerous in
the middle of the night like this?

08:41.590 --> 08:43.280
What are you saying, old man?

08:43.460 --> 08:45.580
This place isn't America or anything.

08:45.730 --> 08:46.890
Here. My expression of gratitude.

08:47.560 --> 08:48.690
It's fine.

08:49.130 --> 08:50.120
Don't worry about it.

08:50.200 --> 08:51.290
Why?

08:51.400 --> 08:52.760
I'm on a diet.

08:53.000 --> 08:53.990
Okay...

08:54.900 --> 08:56.230
Hurry up and get going.

08:56.540 --> 08:57.330
Yes...

09:00.340 --> 09:01.330
Oh no!

09:04.280 --> 09:05.210
So close!

09:05.280 --> 09:06.040
Who?

09:06.150 --> 09:07.140
My dad.

09:07.350 --> 09:09.650
He would have brought me back
if he had found me.

09:10.720 --> 09:11.510
Hey...

09:11.820 --> 09:14.380
Can I still have that juice?

09:14.890 --> 09:16.010
Yeah! Here!

09:16.490 --> 09:17.220
Thank you!

09:18.930 --> 09:19.590
Wait!

09:19.660 --> 09:20.460
What!

09:20.560 --> 09:21.620
S-Stop!

09:51.860 --> 09:52.920
Get it together!

09:53.690 --> 09:54.290
Why...

09:54.800 --> 09:57.730
Why would you do
such a horrible thing?

09:58.070 --> 09:58.760
Naoya!

10:00.900 --> 10:01.330
What's wrong!

10:02.740 --> 10:03.730
Again...

10:04.140 --> 10:05.470
I can see it again.

10:06.410 --> 10:07.240
That person...

10:08.340 --> 10:09.830
That woman...

10:39.840 --> 10:41.070
Shut up!

11:02.130 --> 11:03.430
Naoya! Naoya!

11:03.860 --> 11:04.850
Help me!

11:05.570 --> 11:06.130
Help me, Brother.

11:06.130 --> 11:06.790
Help me, Brother.
Naoya...

11:06.870 --> 11:07.370
Help me!

11:07.370 --> 11:08.230
Help me!
It's okay.

11:09.940 --> 11:10.540
Help me!

11:10.540 --> 11:11.500
Help me!
Get it together!

11:11.570 --> 11:12.440
I'm scared...

11:15.940 --> 11:16.840
Naoya!

11:21.980 --> 11:22.810
What happened!

11:31.560 --> 11:32.250
Naoya!

11:38.870 --> 11:39.920
I'm scared...

11:44.200 --> 11:46.230
Brother, help me.

11:47.210 --> 11:48.700
Get it together, Naoya.

11:48.980 --> 11:50.200
5 people...

11:50.810 --> 11:53.800
Those two have killed 5 people.

11:55.050 --> 11:56.480
Help, Brother...

11:56.750 --> 11:57.740
Naoya...

11:58.490 --> 11:59.540
I'll save you.

12:00.390 --> 12:01.880
I will definitely save you!

12:16.840 --> 12:19.070
We finally got out of there.

12:20.340 --> 12:22.600
We finally got to be free.

12:24.310 --> 12:26.370
But why are things like this?

12:38.830 --> 12:39.790
Naoya...

12:40.890 --> 12:45.090
I'm definitely running away from
this place and getting outside.

12:47.530 --> 12:49.200
I'm going to become free.

13:34.350 --> 13:35.470
What's the matter?

13:35.950 --> 13:36.680
Naoya...

14:31.870 --> 14:32.430
Jiro!

14:32.970 --> 14:34.170
Wake up, Jiro!

14:35.410 --> 14:36.380
Wh-What?

14:41.980 --> 14:43.570
Reiko, what's wrong?

14:43.920 --> 14:45.580
They are watching us the whole time.

14:45.650 --> 14:46.450
What?

14:48.860 --> 14:50.150
Damn it!

14:53.760 --> 14:56.700
You people won't take me down.

14:57.430 --> 14:58.460
Reiko?

15:04.910 --> 15:06.370
Damn it!

15:18.150 --> 15:19.020
Where!

15:19.290 --> 15:20.280
Where did you go!

15:21.050 --> 15:22.020
Reiko...

15:29.400 --> 15:30.230
There it is.

15:30.800 --> 15:32.700
Reiko, stop it.

15:33.230 --> 15:35.000
I beg you. Stop, Reiko!

15:35.270 --> 15:36.760
But over there!

15:41.680 --> 15:43.840
I won't lose!

15:43.980 --> 15:45.310
Reiko, calm down.

15:46.210 --> 15:47.340
Come on...

15:47.550 --> 15:48.710
Let's go to bed.

15:51.220 --> 15:52.380
Reiko?

15:53.220 --> 15:55.350
Jiro, stay right there.

15:56.120 --> 15:58.680
You are a good boy,
so just stay like that for a second.

15:59.390 --> 16:00.520
What? Reiko?

16:00.590 --> 16:02.080
N-No!

16:04.130 --> 16:06.530
<i>Young woman's body found
in one room of love hotel.</i>

16:09.500 --> 16:11.660
<i>Missing high school girl
found as corpse.</i>

16:11.740 --> 16:13.800
I found 4 articles.

16:19.210 --> 16:21.480
They have found 4 victims.

16:24.890 --> 16:25.870
But...

16:26.190 --> 16:27.950
You've seen 5 people.

16:28.090 --> 16:30.960
Is it because they haven't
found the 5th victim yet?

16:31.360 --> 16:33.350
The reason why you're
suffering so much...

16:37.260 --> 16:38.360
Purple clothing.

16:40.070 --> 16:45.270
That woman thinks that people wearing
purple clothing are all her enemies.

16:46.410 --> 16:49.000
She's being thrown
around by obsession.

16:49.340 --> 16:53.900
That man loves being
thrown around by that woman.

16:54.310 --> 16:58.770
Being ordered around, picked on,
and having to apologize...

17:00.090 --> 17:01.550
I can't believe...

17:02.220 --> 17:04.920
...that there is that sort of
man and woman relationship.

17:05.990 --> 17:08.480
Everyone is distorted
somewhere inside of them.

17:09.760 --> 17:12.160
And the problem is where that is.

17:12.970 --> 17:13.990
Definitely.

17:15.240 --> 17:17.570
That's what determines how they live.

17:19.210 --> 17:20.000
Keep it together.

17:20.710 --> 17:22.830
I'll definitely find the answer out.

17:25.010 --> 17:25.840
Yeah...

17:27.880 --> 17:32.980
The other women were strangled
or had their heads beat in.

17:33.690 --> 17:36.160
And they left the body
just lying in the room.

17:36.960 --> 17:39.520
They don't care if the body is found.

17:40.630 --> 17:42.820
But the 5th woman is...

17:48.700 --> 17:49.500
What's wrong?

18:04.720 --> 18:05.780
What's wrong, Naoya!

18:06.620 --> 18:07.420
Naoya!

18:07.650 --> 18:08.250
Get it together!

18:10.990 --> 18:11.790
Naoya!

18:34.810 --> 18:36.370
<i>The purple woman
is going to kill Reiko!</i>

18:36.450 --> 18:38.820
<i>Kill Reiko</i>

18:40.950 --> 18:42.980
I won't lose.

18:43.560 --> 18:46.460
People like you won't defeat me!

18:49.930 --> 18:53.300
I won't be defeated that easily!

18:53.370 --> 18:53.970
Reiko...

18:53.970 --> 18:54.870
Reiko...
I won't lose!

18:54.870 --> 18:55.890
I won't lose!

18:56.040 --> 18:56.660
Yeah...

18:56.740 --> 18:57.760
Yeah, yeah...

18:58.270 --> 18:59.600
I won't lose!

19:14.550 --> 19:16.280
How are you feeling?

19:16.790 --> 19:17.720
Yeah...

19:22.200 --> 19:24.390
I feel calm when I'm in nature.

19:28.440 --> 19:29.330
I see.

20:12.780 --> 20:14.110
Elder Misaki...

20:16.120 --> 20:19.050
He was the one that made the barrier.

20:20.690 --> 20:22.420
The negative powers...

20:23.760 --> 20:26.350
How you are suffering them so much...

20:28.900 --> 20:32.990
I thought you and I both
had grown more.

20:35.030 --> 20:36.870
The world is so vast.

20:37.770 --> 20:39.360
There are so many different people.

20:40.210 --> 20:41.070
Yeah.

20:42.180 --> 20:44.510
It's different from the laboratory.

21:09.640 --> 21:11.190
There is a flow.

21:13.440 --> 21:17.240
It's a flow like a big river.

21:18.010 --> 21:23.210
The barrier being broken was
an occurrence within that flow.

21:25.990 --> 21:32.750
There is a definite reason for the
negative powers being drawn to you.

21:33.760 --> 21:37.200
If you don't run from it,
you can find the answer.

21:59.090 --> 22:00.210
What is...

22:00.750 --> 22:01.690
...this?

22:11.200 --> 22:12.030
What...

22:15.030 --> 22:15.930
Brother...

22:16.270 --> 22:17.330
Help me!

22:29.920 --> 22:38.720
<i>I hope that everything that
makes you sad will all disappear.</i>

22:38.790 --> 22:47.560
<i>The words that I said that day
are still tightening my chest.</i>

22:47.630 --> 22:56.410
<i>A single shadow looked like light
in this world that I'm imprisoned in.</i>

22:56.480 --> 23:05.210
<i>The rain of May became lighter
as it was kindly shining tomorrow.</i>

23:05.290 --> 23:09.620
<i>I lost the meaning of smiling...</i>

23:09.690 --> 23:13.990
<i>... that day I thought I
lost my place to be.</i>

23:14.060 --> 23:18.430
<i>I wished for your warmth.</i>

23:18.500 --> 23:22.940
<i>We have stopped time.</i>

23:23.170 --> 23:27.270
<i>I had this feeling it was
eventually going to come, but...</i>

23:27.340 --> 23:31.900
<i>... I pretended I didn't know
and buried my loneliness.</i>

23:31.980 --> 23:42.080
<i>I looked down at your feet as the
droplets describing "Good-bye" fell.</i>

23:42.720 --> 23:51.460
<i>I hope that everything that
makes you sad will all disappear.</i>

23:51.530 --> 23:59.910
<i>The words that I said that day
are still tightening my chest.</i>

24:02.010 --> 24:04.940
Naoya finds out what his true powers are.

24:05.980 --> 24:09.470
It is the power to see the future.

24:09.780 --> 24:11.270
It is called premonition.

24:12.690 --> 24:14.310
Time to be free from...

24:14.420 --> 24:17.290
...the nightmares of despair that have
continued from his younger days.

24:18.090 --> 24:21.490
One distorted weapon is going to
draw its curtains down.

24:22.700 --> 24:29.860
<i>Episode 4, "Trace"</i>

24:25.900 --> 24:28.600
Where are we headed?
